    "frequentlyAskedQuestions": {
      "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
      "description": "Everything you need to know about Jazzam",
      "questions": {
        "question1": "How does the AI generate leads?",
        "answer1": "Jazzam collects leads from your website and campaigns (LinkedIn & Snapchat), then analyzes behavior such as visits or interactions. It classifies them (Hot – Warm – Cold) and provides next-step recommendations: call, follow-up, or ignore.",
        "question2": "What makes Jazzam different?",
        "answer2": "Jazzam doesn’t just collect data, it analyzes and gives actionable recommendations. It integrates multiple channels, is built for Saudi Arabia, and is simple to use.",
        "question3": "How does Jazzam ensure data security?",
        "answer3": "Security isn’t an add-on at Jazzaam —it’s the foundation of everything we build. Your data is protected through advanced encryption during storage and transmission, governed by a smart access-control system that ensures only authorized use. All data is hosted within Saudi Arabia, fully compliant with the Saudi Personal Data Protection Law (PDPL), so you can trust that your information stays private, safe, and sovereign.",
        "question4": "Can I try Jazzam for free?",
        "answer4": "Yes, you can start a free trial to run your first campaign and track leads immediately.",
        "question5": "Does Jazzam integrate with my current systems?",
        "answer5": "Yes, it integrates with CRMs, marketing tools, and allows easy export to Excel or CSV."
      }
    },
